Scope
-----
The CC BY 4.0 license applies to the authors' derived compilation in this folder: the selection,
cleaning, classification (IT scope, product markets, buyer sectors, procedure codes), firm-name
canonicalization, buyer-label splitting, pseudonymization and documentation of the records, as
released in contracts_v3.csv, firm_name_map_v3.csv, bid_counts_sample.csv and audit/.

The underlying facts (tender numbers, buyers, winners, dates, amounts, procedures, bid counts) are
public records published by the Public Procurement Authority of Türkiye (Kamu İhale Kurumu, KİK) on
the Electronic Public Procurement Platform EKAP (https://ekapv2.kik.gov.tr) under Public Procurement
Law No. 4734. No rights are claimed over those facts. The CPI series (cpi_turkey*.csv) are
compiled from TÜİK / World Bank sources listed in cpi_turkey_SOURCES.txt.

