Personal data
-------------
Names of natural persons are pseudonymized (see README.md). Do not attempt to re-identify
pseudonymized suppliers; any re-use must comply with Turkish Law No. 6698 on the Protection of
Personal Data (KVKK) and, where applicable, the EU GDPR.

